---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
import Badge from "../components/Badge.astro";
import notepad from "../assets/icons8-notepad-24.png";
---

<Layout title="Welcome to my portfolio">
  <main class="bg-mint-500 p-3">
    <section
      class="w-[80%] mx-auto mb-4 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg px-6 py-8 ring shadow-xl ring-gray-900/5"
    >
      <div>
        <h1
          class="uppercase text-5xl text-center font-bold flex gap-x-4 pb-10"
        >
          Hello! I'm Yuliana Mallorga.
          <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
            <Badge>
              <a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yuliana-mallorga/"
                target="_blank">Currently available for work!</a
              >
            </Badge>
          </div>
        </h1>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-5 tracking-tight text-2xl">
        "I have three years of experience in web development, and I am
        passionate about programming. I am from Tucumán, Argentina 🇦🇷. I
        specialize in creating unique applications by applying my knowledge of
        frontend and backend development."
      </h2>
    </section>

    <section
      class="w-[80%] mx-auto bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-lg px-6 py-8 ring shadow-xl ring-gray-900/5"
    >
      <div>
        <span
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-indigo-500 p-2 shadow-lg"
      >
        <img
          class="w-6 h-6 stroke-white self-center"
          src={notepad.src}
          alt="notepad"
        />
      </span>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2 text-sm indent-px">
          I specialize in UI design, responsive web design, and visual
          development, as well as backend development. My expertise includes
          building dynamic and scalable web applications, optimizing
          performance, and integrating APIs.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2 text-sm indent-px">
          I have experience working with modern frameworks and technologies such
          as Astro, React, Node.js, Express, and databases like MongoDB/MySQL.
          On the frontend, I work with Tailwind CSS and Bootstrap to create
          beautiful and responsive user interfaces. I am also skilled in version
          control with Git, deployment processes, and working with agile
          methodologies like Scrum to ensure efficient and collaborative project
          development.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2 text-sm indent-px">
          I enjoy solving complex problems, improving user experiences, and
          constantly learning new technologies to stay up to date in the
          ever-evolving web development landscape.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
